[38;5;16m[48;5;153m ☐ Surface [39m[49m

[1m[38;5;231mWhich surface should own preferences storage?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mBrowser webapp (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mStore in localStorage from app.js/index.html. Persists per browser+device, no backend needed.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Node side (src/)
     [38;5;246mPersist to a JSON config file on disk, read by src/index.js on startup.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Shared module, both
     [38;5;246mOne preferences API with pluggable browser + file backends. Most flexible, adds an abstraction layer.[39m
